<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - PhyCor Inc.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - PhyCor Inc.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Piper Jaffray said it reinstated coverage of PhyCor Inc with a strong buy rating.</p>
<p>-- said raised the 1997 earnings estimate to $0.84 a share from $0.82 a share and the 1998 estimate to $1.14 a share from $1.12 a share.</p>
<p>-- said PhyCor's business fundamentals &quot;remain outstanding.&quot;</p>
<p>-- set a 12-month price target of $40 a share.</p>
<p>-- Phycor gained 5/8 to 30-3/4.</p>
</text>
